# Rule Registry (twork-builder)

## Sources
- Curated from [PatrickJS/awesome-cursorrules](https://github.com/PatrickJS/awesome-cursorrules) — **adapted**, not a full clone
- Ported and re-scoped from the `dbs-mtj` Cursor setup (SharePoint/ASPX rules dropped)
- WordPress skills from [WordPress/agent-skills](https://github.com/WordPress/agent-skills) — see `skills-lock.json`

Related map: `.cursor/INTEGRATION.md`.

## Precedence (conflict = higher wins)
1. `.cursorrules`
2. `.agents/skills/*` (mirrored at `.cursor/skills/*`)
3. Always-on `.mdc` — `anti-overengineering`, `anti-sycophancy`, `security-appsec`, `context-handoff`, `codegraph-auto`, `wordpress-skills`, `tech-lead`
4. Gated `.mdc` — `js-code-quality`, `web-app-optimization`, `landing-page-image-quality`, `clickr-coding-standards`, `qa-bug-report`
5. `docs/standards/` raw stack files (lowest)

