## Clickr Coding Standards (docs + gated)
- Archive SoT: `docs/standards/` — `CODING-STANDARDS.md`, `php-wordpress.md`, `javascript.md`
- `php-wordpress.md` = **primary stack** here (unlike dbs-mtj, where it was docs-only)
- `javascript.md` Next.js / Supabase / Zod sections = other-repo reference; blocks follow `js-code-quality.mdc`
- Composer-managed-site rules in the archive do not override this plugin's `wp-scripts` build

## awesome-cursorrules screened and REJECTED (with reason)
| Upstream file | Why not |
|---|---|
| `codequality`, `github-code-quality` | “No summaries · no confirmations · single-chunk edits” **directly fights** the `.cursorrules` Scout→`(y?)` workflow and the required QA JSON. `github-code-quality` is also legacy regex-JSON, not a real rule |
| `clean-code` | “Refactor continuously · leave it cleaner · write tests first” fights `anti-overengineering`; no test infra here; the rest duplicates `js-code-quality` |
| `optimize-dry-solid-principles` | Empty section headings and a `pyproject.toml` reference — unusable |
| `gitflow` | Mandates a `develop` + `release/*` + `hotfix/*` layer; this repo ships off `main` |
| `wordpress-php-guzzle-gutenberg` | “Prefer TypeScript over JavaScript” and “favour functional over OO” contradict this plain-JS / `class-twork-*.php` tree; the usable WPCS lines are already in `clickr-coding-standards` |
| `cursorrules-cursor-ai-wordpress-draft-macos` | Describes a different product (PressThat tray app) |
| `readme-best-practices` | Landing-page README advice fights the WP.org `readme.txt` format this plugin must ship |
| `security-devsecops-ssdls-appsec` | Duplicate AppSec pack — `security-appsec.mdc` wins |
| `web-app-optimization` (raw) | Misnamed SvelteKit/Tailwind dump — the rewrite is installed instead |
| Next.js / React / Vue / Svelte / Tailwind / shadcn / TypeScript packs | Foreign stacks; scaffolding them into this plugin root is a hard reject |
| Cypress / Playwright / Jest / Vitest packs | No test infrastructure in this repo — re-screen if one is ever added |
| `drupal-11`, `laravel-*`, `shopify-theme-dev-liquid`, `typo3cms-*` | Other CMS/framework stacks |

