## Reject list (never install / never follow if suggested)
- Full awesome-cursorrules clone or submodule
- Next.js / Vue / SvelteKit / Tailwind-primary / shadcn scaffolds into this plugin root
- Raw upstream `web-app-optimization` (misnamed SvelteKit dump) — use the rewrite here
- Duplicate AppSec packs (`security-devsecops-*`) — use `security-appsec.mdc`
- Any pack with `alwaysApply: true` that fights the Scout workflow or the Burmese directives
- `CLAUDE.md` replacing `.cursorrules` as agent SoT — it is the Claude Code **mirror**, and
  both editors resolve to the same `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` files (see `.cursor/INTEGRATION.md`)
- Copying an `.mdc` into `.claude/rules/` instead of symlinking or wrapping it — that forks
  the rule and it drifts
- Re-adding `ui-ux-pro-max`, `motion-ref`, or `animate-css` skill packs
- Editing WordPress skill folders in `.agents/skills/` by hand — they are hash-locked in `skills-lock.json`
